# Copy to ~/.config/paodo/.env (or $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/paodo/.env), then fill both in.
#
# PAODO_ENDPOINT — the programmatic base URL of your PAODO app, no trailing slash, no query or
#                  fragment, and no credentials in the URL. https, or http for localhost only.
# PAODO_TOKEN    — the CLI token for that app.
#
# Read from that file regardless of where you run `paodo` from. Exported variables of the same
# name take precedence over whatever is written here.

PAODO_ENDPOINT=
PAODO_TOKEN=
